<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>some.pics (中文)</title><link>https://some.pics</link><description>只是网上的一些图片。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 14:29:44 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>意大利美食</title><link>https://some.pics/6aa9565458c1b</link><description>&lt;p&gt;意大利美食&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt='Storefront of DELITALY Italian food shop with brown awning displaying "PRODOTTI ITALIANI SALUMERIA" and shelves of jarred pickled vegetables and preserved foods behind glass windows.' height="2345" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/mihobu/6aa9565458c1b.jpg" width="2231"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://mihobu.some.pics"&gt;@mihobu&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 14:29:44 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>巴黎圣日耳曼德佩教堂内部</title><link>https://some.pics/6aa93d69dcb82</link><description>&lt;p&gt;巴黎圣日耳曼德佩教堂内部&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Interior of a Gothic cathedral with ornate arches, decorative columns, and colorful tilework. A chandelier hangs from chains. Painted religious figures adorn the walls." height="2334" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/mihobu/6aa93d69dcb82.jpg" width="2362"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://mihobu.some.pics"&gt;@mihobu&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 12:43:25 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>在巴黎的圣叙尔皮斯教堂（Église Saint Sulpice）内</title><link>https://some.pics/6aa93ca40c0e1</link><description>&lt;p&gt;在巴黎的圣叙尔皮斯教堂（Église Saint Sulpice）内&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Interior of a grand cathedral with wooden chairs arranged in rows facing an ornate altar. Tall dark columns, a large clock, gilt chandelier, and classical architectural details visible throughout the solemn space." height="2524" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/mihobu/6aa93ca40c0e1.jpg" width="2524"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://mihobu.some.pics"&gt;@mihobu&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 12:40:09 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>水果与豆类</title><link>https://some.pics/6aa93a7a3f8a1</link><description>&lt;p&gt;水果与豆类&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt='A fruit and vegetable shop storefront in Paris with an orange awning reads "Fruits &amp;amp; Legumes" and "Le Verger des 4 Saisons." Produce displays line the entrance with apples, berries, and other items. Ivy grows up the left wall.' height="2176" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/mihobu/6aa93a7a3f8a1.jpg" width="2176"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://mihobu.some.pics"&gt;@mihobu&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 12:30:54 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>有趣的小家伙</title><link>https://some.pics/6aa93059f2370</link><description>&lt;p&gt;有趣的小家伙&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A small bee takes off from within a pink autumn crocus. " height="3024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/tristy/6aa93059f2370.jpg" width="4032"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://tristy.some.pics"&gt;@tristy&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 11:47:42 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>在巴黎的圣叙尔皮斯教堂（Église Saint Sulpice）内</title><link>https://some.pics/6aa9272373c86</link><description>&lt;p&gt;在巴黎的圣叙尔皮斯教堂（Église Saint Sulpice）内&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Interior of a grand chapel with ornate gold-trimmed domed ceiling, large fresco above altar, Corinthian columns, and religious paintings on side walls. A person kneels at the altar railing." height="2688" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/mihobu/6aa9272373c86.jpg" width="4032"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://mihobu.some.pics"&gt;@mihobu&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 11:08:24 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>一只蝴蝶朋友。我还看见了一只那种像蜂鸟一样酷的飞蛾，但它太快了。</title><link>https://some.pics/6aa90a0ebbc8c</link><description>&lt;p&gt;一只蝴蝶朋友。我还看见了一只那种像蜂鸟一样酷的飞蛾，但它太快了。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A brown, orange, red and black butterfly sits on a a leaf among flowers flapping its wings." height="5712" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/tristy/6aa90a0ebbc8c.jpg" width="4284"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://tristy.some.pics"&gt;@tristy&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 09:04:18 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>圆湖今晨日出</title><link>https://some.pics/6aa806fdd16db</link><description>&lt;p&gt;今天早上，圆湖上那一点点日出真是无与伦比。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="The setting sun casts a golden glow over a calm lake filled with plants, reflecting on the water while silhouetting distant trees." height="4284" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/ericmwalk/6aa806fdd16db.jpg" width="5712"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://ericmwalk.some.pics"&gt;@ericmwalk&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 14 Sep 2026 14:38:58 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>周一心情</title><link>https://some.pics/6aa7d67cbe138</link><description>&lt;p&gt;周一的心情&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A chestnut, lying in green grass, lit from behind; although parts of the outer fruit is missing, the white skin still clings to the seed. The way the chestnut is positioned, along with two brown spots and a crack in the inner skin, makes it resemble a somewhat sad face. " height="2190" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/roteskuffen/6aa7d67cbe138.jpg" width="2736"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://roteskuffen.some.pics"&gt;@roteskuffen&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 14 Sep 2026 11:12:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>早上好，今天早上！</title><link>https://some.pics/6aa79cfd13dae</link><description>&lt;p&gt;早上好，今天早上！&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Edegem # 5,1 km" height="1486" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/atog/6aa79cfd13dae.jpg" width="1179"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://atog.some.pics"&gt;@atog&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 14 Sep 2026 07:06:40 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>